<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.108 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.108 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday its offer of NZ$100 million of February 2001 bonds yielded an average 7.108 percent.</p>
<p>In a tender on October 31, NZ$100 million of the same bonds yielded an average 7.197 percent.  </p>
<p>There was a total of $167 million bids in the tender and the successful bids ranged from 7.07-7.14 percent.</p>
<p>Settlement date is December 17.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
